    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Search for \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" on these iPaaS platforms:\n1. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:zapier.com/apps\n2. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:make.com/en/integrations\n3. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:workato.com/integrations\n\nFor Zapier results, also count triggers and actions listed. Limit searches to 4.\n\nReturn JSON matching the schema directly. Do NOT wrap the response in an \"output\" key or any other envelope. Keep \"details\" compact: only {zapier: {found, count}, make: {found}, workato: {found}}. Do not include search_query, result strings, or a summary field.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
